  "扫描件和 PDF 经过 OCR、标签与全文索引后统一归档，找材料时不再依赖文件名和目录记忆。": "Scans and PDFs are archived in a unified manner after OCR, tags and full-text indexing, so you no longer rely on file names and directory memory when looking for materials.",
