  "团队资料、服务说明、脱敏案例和 PDF 被整理成可维护结构。": "Team materials, service descriptions, desensitization cases and PDFs are organized into maintainable structures.",
  "脱敏案例": "Desensitization case",
  "脱敏案例与专业文章解释工作重点，不承诺结果，也不暴露当事人信息。": "Desensitization cases and professional articles explain the key points of the work, without promising results or revealing the information of the parties involved.",
  "完成真机运行版本，消息、附件、引用、Markdown 与公式链路均通过定向测试。": "The real machine running version has been completed, and messages, attachments, quotes, Markdown and formula links have all passed targeted testing.",
