  "网页可以查看传感器、切换自动或固定转速，并由守护逻辑恢复长期运行策略。": "Web pages can view sensors, toggle automatic or fixed speeds, and have the daemon logic restore long-term operating strategies.",
  "网页收藏": "Web page collection",
  "网站已经上线，但可持续交付才是这个项目真正完成的部分。": "The website is already live, but sustainable delivery is the real part of this project.",
  "围绕 Docker、Tailscale、Cloudflare、对象存储、监控与备份维护个人服务底座。": "Maintain a personal service base around Docker, Tailscale, Cloudflare, object storage, monitoring and backup.",
  "维护摘要": "Maintenance summary",
  "为本地图片生成、视频处理和推理工作流提供算力。": "Provide computing power for local image generation, video processing and inference workflows.",
  "为代理面板注入后端地址，并把浏览器请求转发到内部服务。": "Inject the backend address into the proxy panel and forward browser requests to the internal service.",
  "为什么自建": "Why build it yourself?",
  "为项目截图、生成图片和应用文件提供统一对象接口。": "Provides a unified object interface for project screenshots, generated images and application files.",
  "为真实机构设计内容、咨询与人工接管链路。": "Design content, consulting and manual takeover links for real organizations.",
  "温度与风扇": "Temperature and fan",
  "文档到本地处理": "Document processing locally",
  "文档归档": "Document archiving",
  "文件到 OCR 与全文索引": "File to OCR and full text indexing",
  "文件同步": "File synchronization",
  "文章阅读": "Article reading",
  "文章资料库": "Article database",
  "问题": "question",
  "我把自己备考时最容易断开的几个动作重新接在一起：先判断薄弱章节，再完成作答和即时反馈，随后由复习计划安排下一次出现，最后把真正没想明白的内容交给 AI 和个人知识库继续处理。": "I reconnected several actions that were most easily disconnected when I was preparing for the exam: I first judged the weak chapters, then completed the answers and immediate feedback, and then arranged the next appearance through the review plan, and finally handed over the content that I really didn’t understand to AI and personal knowledge base for further processing.",
  "我不太喜欢让问题停在“凑合用”的状态。刷题体验不顺手，就做自己的题库；想把 AI 放进真实工作流，就自己写客户端、接口和部署。": "I don't really like leaving things in a \"make do\" state. If the experience of answering questions is not smooth, just make your own question bank; if you want to put AI into real workflow, write your own client, interface and deployment.",
  "我从具体问题开始，自己完成界面、开发、部署和维护。比起短暂演示，我更在意产品能否真正被使用，并在几个月后依然稳定。": "I started with a specific problem and did the interface, development, deployment, and maintenance myself. Rather than a short demo, I care more about whether the product can actually be used and remain stable after a few months.",
  "我的服务器": "My server",
  "我的服务器 | lij768423-svg": "My server |lij768423-svg",
  "我的工作": "my job",
  "我的收藏项目": "Selected projects",
  "我的桌搭": "My desk setup",
  "我的桌搭 | lij768423-svg": "My table set |lij768423-svg",
  "我对数码桌搭、健身、穿搭和硬件 DIY 都很感兴趣。它们看起来分散，但吸引我的地方很一致：观察细节、反复调整，并把手边的东西改到真正适合自己。": "I'm interested in digital desk building, fitness, clothing, and hardware DIY. They seem scattered, but what attracts me is the same: observing details, adjusting repeatedly, and changing the things at hand to really suit myself.",
  "我能做的部分": "the part i can do",
  "我是一名正在准备考研的个人开发者。大部分时间在专业课、真题和代码之间切换，也在慢慢找到一套能长期坚持的节奏。": "I am an individual developer preparing for the postgraduate entrance examination. I spend most of my time switching between professional courses, real questions, and codes, and I am slowly finding a rhythm that I can stick to for a long time.",
  "我为所有服务重新设计了一张首页。": "I redesigned a homepage for all services.",
  "我喜欢从一个具体问题开始，自己完成界面、开发、部署和维护。比起短暂的演示，我更在意它能不能真正被使用，并在几个月后依然稳定。": "I like to start with a specific problem and do the interface, development, deployment, and maintenance myself. Rather than a short demo, I care more about whether it can actually be used and remain stable after a few months.",
  "我怎样把事情做完": "how do i get things done",
  "我最常用的 10 个容器。": "My top 10 most used containers.",
  "我做学习产品、AI 客户端、客户交付和个人基础设施。设计、开发、部署与长期维护都由我完成。": "I work on learning products, AI clients, customer delivery, and personal infrastructure. The design, development, deployment and long-term maintenance are all done by me.",
  "五个底部入口、业务与律师详情、文章案例、律所介绍和咨询对话均使用原生页面，并接入官网专用接口。": "The five bottom entrances, business and lawyer details, articles and cases, law firm introductions and consultation conversations all use native pages and are connected to the official website’s dedicated interface.",
  "系统": "system",
  "系统记录连续正确次数和下一次到期时间。连续答对后离开普通错题列表，但长期复习计划仍然保留。": "The system records the number of consecutive correct entries and the next expiration time. After consecutive correct answers, the list of common wrong questions will be removed, but the long-term review plan will still be retained.",
  "系统盘与独立数据盘分别承载运行环境、Compose 配置和业务数据。": "The system disk and independent data disk carry the operating environment, Compose configuration and business data respectively.",
