  "形成可直接静态部署的 408 学习产品，题库、复习、统计与知识沉淀在同一工作流中运行。": "Forming a 408 learning product that can be directly deployed statically, the question bank, review, statistics and knowledge precipitation run in the same workflow.",
  "形成内网可访问的只读诊断页，可以快速比较节点延迟、路径类型和探针状态。": "A read-only diagnostic page accessible within the intranet is formed to quickly compare node latency, path type, and probe status.",
  "形成长期运行的个人服务底座，公开服务、内网工具、存储和恢复流程拥有清晰边界。": "A long-running personal service base is formed, with clear boundaries between public services, intranet tools, storage and recovery processes.",
