  "以 SwiftUI 重建会话界面，用 UIKit 补齐输入法边界，URLSession 处理 SSE，Keychain 与本地存储管理状态。": "Use SwiftUI to rebuild the session interface, use UIKit to complete the input method boundary, and URLSession to handle SSE, Keychain and local storage management status.",
