  "用 FastAPI 接收结构化题目，生成 Markdown、更新索引和日志，再以本地文件为真源进行可选同步。": "Use FastAPI to receive structured questions, generate Markdown, update indexes and logs, and then perform optional synchronization using local files as the source of truth.",
  "用 Next.js 与 Payload CMS 重建内容体系，将团队、服务、脱敏案例、咨询和隐私流程接入同一后台。": "Use Next.js and Payload CMS to rebuild the content system and connect teams, services, desensitization cases, consultation and privacy processes to the same backend.",
  "用 Python 标准库提供窄接口，读取 Linux hwmon，并只允许调用预定义的风扇通道与模式。": "Provides a narrow interface using the Python standard library, reads Linux hwmon, and only allows calling predefined fan channels and modes.",
